11
01:07:56,470 --> 01:08:02,470
Red Scorpion is a 1988 American action film starring
Dolph Lundgren and directed by Joseph Zito.

12
01:14:07,058 --> 01:14:13,058
Lundgren appears as a Soviet special forces ("Spetsnaz") operative sent to assassinate
an anti-communist rebel leader in Africa, only to side with the rebels.

13
01:20:17,647 --> 01:20:23,647
It was produced by lobbyist Jack Abramoff and controversially filmed in South West
Africa with the support of the apartheid-era South African government.

14
01:26:28,235 --> 01:26:34,235
The film was released in the United States on April 21, 1989.

15
01:32:38,823 --> 01:32:44,823
It is the first installment in the Red Scorpion film series.

16
01:38:49,411 --> 01:38:55,411
The film explores themes of cold war, traitor,
mission of murder, uprising, revenge.
